h=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f5/Portrait_Esther.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Esther\" title=\"Esther\">Esther</a> on the <a href=\"/wiki/Rosymorn_Monastery_Trail\" title=\"Rosymorn Monastery Trail\">Rosymorn Monastery Trail</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Exxvikyap\" title=\"Exxvikyap\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Portrait_Exxvikyap.png/25px-Portrait_Exxvikyap.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Portrait_Exxvikyap.png/38px-Portrait_Exxvikyap.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Portrait_Exxvikyap.png/50px-Portrait_Exxvikyap.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Exxvikyap\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Portrait_Exxvikyap.png/25px-Portrait_Exxvikyap.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Portrait_Exxvikyap.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Exxvikyap\" title=\"Exxvikyap\">Exxvikyap</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Rivington_General\" title=\"Rivington General\">Rivington General</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Rivington\" title=\"Rivington\">Rivington</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fytz\" title=\"Fytz\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/98/Portrait_Fytz.png/25px-Portrait_Fytz.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/98/Portrait_Fytz.png/38px-Portrait_Fytz.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/98/Portrait_Fytz.png/50px-Portrait_Fytz.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fytz the Firecracker\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/98/Portrait_Fytz.png/25px-Portrait_Fytz.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/98/Portrait_Fytz.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Fytz\" title=\"Fytz\">Fytz the Firecracker</a> at the <a href=\"/wiki/Stormshore_Armoury\" title=\"Stormshore Armoury\">Stormshore Armoury</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Lower_City\" title=\"Lower City\">Lower City</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-38&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-83</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lann_Tarv\" title=\"Lann Tarv\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/42/Portrait_Lann_Tarv.png/25px-Portrait_Lann_Tarv.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/42/Portrait_Lann_Tarv.png/38px-Portrait_Lann_Tarv.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/42/Portrait_Lann_Tarv.png/50px-Portrait_Lann_Tarv.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lann Tarv\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/42/Portrait_Lann_Tarv.png/25px-Portrait_Lann_Tarv.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/42/Portrait_Lann_Tarv.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lann_Tarv\" title=\"Lann Tarv\">Lann Tarv</a> on the Main Floor of <a href=\"/wiki/Moonrise_Towers\" title=\"Moonrise Towers\">Moonrise Towers</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Popper\" title=\"Popper\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Portrait_Popper.png/25px-Portrait_Popper.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Portrait_Popper.png/38px-Portrait_Popper.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Portrait_Popper.png/50px-Portrait_Popper.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Popper\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Portrait_Popper.png/25px-Portrait_Popper.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/87/Portrait_Popper.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Popper\" title=\"Popper\">Popper</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Circus_of_the_Last_Days\" title=\"Circus of the Last Days\">Circus of the Last Days</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Talli\" title=\"Talli\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d2/Portrait_Talli.png/25px-Portrait_Talli.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d2/Portrait_Talli.png/38px-Portrait_Talli.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d2/Portrait_Talli.png/50px-Portrait_Talli.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Quartermaster Talli\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d2/Portrait_Talli.png/25px-Portrait_Talli.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d2/Portrait_Talli.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Talli\" title=\"Talli\">Quartermaster Talli</a> at the <a href=\"/wiki/Last_Light_Inn\" title=\"Last Light Inn\">Last Light Inn</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Roah_Moonglow\" title=\"Roah Moonglow\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Portrait_Roah_Moonglow.png/25px-Portrait_Roah_Moonglow.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e7/Portrait_Roah_Moonglow.png/38px-Portrait_Roah_Moonglow.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e7/Portrait_Roah_Moonglow.png/50px-Portrait_Roah_Moonglow.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Roah Moonglow\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Portrait_Roah_Moonglow.png/25px-Portrait_Roah_Moonglow.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Portrait_Roah_Moonglow.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Roah_Moonglow\" title=\"Roah Moonglow\">Roah Moonglow</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Shattered_Sanctum\" title=\"Shattered Sanctum\">Shattered Sanctum</a> (after reaching Level 6), and on the Main Floor of <a href=\"/wiki/Moonrise_Towers\" title=\"Moonrise Towers\">Moonrise Towers</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n</div>   <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>The effect of this arrow on secondary targets is exactly the same as a regular shot, with the exception of halving the damage source component (<a href=\"/wiki/Damage_Rolls\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Damage Rolls\">weapon damage</a> + <a href=\"/wiki/Enchantment\" title=\"Enchantment\">weapon enchantment</a> + <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Score_Modifier\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability Score Modifier\">ability modifier</a>).</li>\n<li>The halving has no effect on <a href=\"/wiki/Damage_Mechanics\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Damage Mechanics\">damage riders</a> (damage bonuses other than listed above). Notable bonuses unaffected by the reduction include <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sharpshooter:_All_In\" title=\"Sharpshooter: All In\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9c/Sharpshooter_All_In_Icon.webp/25px-Sharpshooter_All_In_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9c/Sharpshooter_All_In_Icon.webp/38px-Sharpshooter_All_In_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9c/Sharpshooter_All_In_Icon.webp/50px-Sharpshooter_All_In_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sharpshooter: All In\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9c/Sharpshooter_All_In_Icon.webp/25px-Sharpshooter_All_In_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9c/Sharpshooter_All_In_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sharpshooter:_All_In\" title=\"Sharpshooter: All In\">Sharpshooter: All In</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Titan_Weapon\" title=\"Titan Weapon\">Titan Weapon</a> of the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Titanstring_Bow\" title=\"Titanstring Bow\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/79/Longbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Longbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/79/Longbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Longbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/79/Longbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Longbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/79/Longbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Longbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/79/Longbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Titanstring_Bow\" title=\"Titanstring Bow\">Titanstring Bow</a>.</li>\n<li>Arrows may ricochet:\n<ul><li>Off any target, including inanimate objects, which is useful against targets otherwise protected by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sanctuary\" title=\"Sanctuary\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Sanctuary_Icon.webp/25px-Sanctuary_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Sanctuary_Icon.webp/38px-Sanctuary_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Sanctuary_Icon.webp/50px-Sanctuary_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sanctuary\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Sanctuary_Icon.webp/25px-Sanctuary_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c1/Sanctuary_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sanctuary\" title=\"Sanctuary\">Sanctuary</a>.</li>\n<li>Into neutral characters and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Knocked_Out_(Condition)\" title=\"Knocked Out (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/97/Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/97/Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/97/Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Knocked Out\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/97/Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/97/Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Knocked_Out_(Condition)\" title=\"Knocked Out (Condition)\">Knocked Out</a> enemies.</li>\n<li>Into invisible characters and break their <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Invisible_(Condition)\" title=\"Invisible (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d7/Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d7/Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d7/Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Invisibility\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d7/Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d7/Invisible_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Invisible_(Condition)\" title=\"Invisible (Condition)\">Invisibility</a>.</li></ul></li>\n<li>Arrows do not ricochet into <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Darkness_(cloud)\" title=\"Darkness (cloud)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e9/Darkness_cloud_Icon.webp/25px-Darkness_cloud_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e9/Darkness_cloud_Icon.webp/38px-Darkness_cloud_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e9/Darkness_cloud_Icon.webp/50px-Darkness_cloud_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Darkness\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e9/Darkness_cloud_Icon.webp/25px-Darkness_cloud_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e9/Darkness_cloud_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Darkness_(cloud)\" title=\"Darkness (cloud)\">Darkness</a>.</li>\n<li>There is a bug, such that if the first arrow crits, all subsequent hits will also crit. This can be forced with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hold_Person\" title=\"Hold Person\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Hold_Person_Icon.webp/25px-Hold_Person_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Hold_Person_Icon.webp/38px-Hold_Person_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Hold_Person_Icon.webp/50px-Hold_Person_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hold Person\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Hold_Person_Icon.webp/25px-Hold_Person_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/75/Hold_Person_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hold_Person\" title=\"Hold Person\">Hold Person</a> or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hold_Monster\" title=\"Hold Monster\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cf/Hold_Monster_Icon.webp/25px-Hold_Monster_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cf/Hold_Monster_Icon.webp/38px-Hold_Monster_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cf/Hold_Monster_Icon.webp/50px-Hold_Monster_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hold Monster\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cf/Hold_Monster_Icon.webp/25px-Hold_Monster_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cf/Hold_Monster_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hold_Monster\" title=\"Hold Monster\">Hold Monster</a>.</li>\n<li>Characters under the effects of an <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Elixir_of_Bloodlust\" title=\"Elixir of Bloodlust\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bd/POT_Potion_of_Vitality_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-POT_Potion_of_Vitality_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/bd/POT_Potion_of_Vitality_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-POT_Potion_of_Vitality_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/bd/POT_Potion_of_Vitality_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-POT_Potion_of_Vitality_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bd/POT_Potion_of_Vitality_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-POT_Potion_of_Vitality_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bd/POT_Potion_of_Vitality_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Elixir_of_Bloodlust\" title=\"Elixir of Bloodlust\">Elixir of Bloodlust</a> can use this arrow to gain an additional action point by targeting the arrow at an object. When the object \"dies\" and a living creature is then hit by the same effect, the game gives you an additional action for killing an enemy, as per the Elixir. This also works with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Chain_Lightning\" title=\"Chain Lightning\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Chain_Lightning_Icon.webp/25px-Chain_Lightning_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Chain_Lightning_Icon.webp/38px-Chain_Lightning_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Chain_Lightning_Icon.webp/50px-Chain_Lightning_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Chain Lightning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Chain_Lightning_Icon.webp/25px-Chain_Lightning_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Chain_Lightning_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Chain_Lightning\" title=\"Chain Lightning\">Chain Lightning</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714200314\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.126 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.133 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 7185/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 75015/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 25784/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 12/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.027/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1479917/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  104.016      1 Template:Misc_item_page\n100.00%  104.016      1 -total\n 46.10%   47.946     27 Template:Icon_text\n 38.92%   40.482     70 Template:Trim\n 31